the cold.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn6le10ob10re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: And that's not the end of it. I was in the middle of keeping the crowd under control, and then my mother called.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Marco</span>: Oh, you haven't seen her for a long time, have you?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: My parents and I used to have regular visits, but that's stopped since my new job started. My father hasn't been well. He's been in the hospital since yesterday.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Marco</span>: Oh, I'm sorry to hear that. Is he alright?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: The doctors have performed some tests. They're not sure yet.", "id": 2, "time": "14500", "image": "engenn6le10ob10re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Marco</span>: What seems to be the problem?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: It's his heart. I know he used to eat a lot of deep-fried food and dishes high in fat. Maybe he hasn't stopped. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Marco</span>: Now the consequences have caught up with him.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: He has stopped taking walks, and he has started just watching movies online all day.", "id": 3, "time": "40750", "image": "engenn6le10ob10re2img06.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn6le10ob10re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn6le10ob10re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}